  "question": {
    "text": "If the nucleus&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mspace></mspace> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> </msubsup> <mtext>Al</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;has a nuclear radius 3.6 fm, then what would be the approximate value of nuclear radius (in fm) of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mspace></mspace> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>12</mn> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </msubsup> <mtext>Te</mtext></mrow></math>?"
  },
